      "cooked": "<p>I know this is at least a year too early, but it is an itch to scratch if I do not ask it.</p>\n<p>Will the new hero/variant art come into the video game? Maybe these art gets unlocked via achievement points (instead of unlock conditions). Heroes with such art then gets an Alternate Art button during hero selection?</p>\n<p>Plus I hope there will be a virtual Collector’s Case for all them cards. And if yes, will it hold all the cards sleeved?</p>",
